\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {III}{\ignorespaces Full RefCOCO validation split, 10{,}834 expressions, released HybridGL scorer. Oracle mIoU 0.8221. $\Delta $ is paired over expressions; CI is a 10{,}000-resample bootstrap; $p$ is a sign-flip permutation test; every $p<0.0001$. ``changed'' counts expressions whose returned index differs from the released row. All deltas are computed from unrounded values, so a delta may differ by $\pm 0.0001$ from the difference of the two rounded mIoU columns shown. The containment snap is a required baseline and is \emph  {not} part of the proposed method.}}{6}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:main}{{III}{6}{Full RefCOCO validation split, 10{,}834 expressions, released HybridGL scorer. Oracle mIoU 0.8221. $\dD $ is paired over expressions; CI is a 10{,}000-resample bootstrap; $p$ is a sign-flip permutation test; every $p<0.0001$. ``changed'' counts expressions whose returned index differs from the released row. All deltas are computed from unrounded values, so a delta may differ by $\pm 0.0001$ from the difference of the two rounded mIoU columns shown. The containment snap is a required baseline and is \emph {not} part of the proposed method}{table.3}{}}
